  "details": "There used to be a mod that disabled controller overlay, the semi transparent render of your controller when you are near an object that can be picked up.\nWorld creators are adding a ton of objects to their worlds and having to see your own controllers in the game really ruins immersion. It can also block vision especially when doing anything where your hands are close to your own face.\nThis could be a simple toggle in the quick menu.",
